A16_SMSS_72_M016936_035                                                       
                                                                              
Apollo 16 Soil Mechanics                                                      
Lunar Self-Recording Penetrometer (LSRP) Page C-2                             
                                                                              
Postflight Penetration Calibration Plot                                       
                                                                              
This handdrawn plot gives the results of postflight calibration tests of      
the Lunar Self-Recording Penetrometer, using drum S/N 2008 set on             
indices 19 and 21.  The plot gives the recorded penetration on the drum       
from 0 to 3 centimeters (abscissa) versus the actual penetration from 0       
to 90 centimeters (ordinate).  Eight data points are shown with a             
straight line running through them.  A note at the top of the plot gives      
the ratio of actual over recorded as 31.25.                                   
